  "notes": "Vendor figures from NVIDIA's own SKU description: **\"NDR InfiniBand Switch, 64 NDR ports, 32 OSFP ports\"** - the 64 logical 400G ports are carried on **32 OSFP800 cages, two lanes each**. Recorded here as 64 x 400G because that is how the switch is cabled and documented; if a topology needs the physical cage count, divide by two. **The cage is declared `qsfpdd`** because OSFP800 is not a cage this engine models - QSFP-DD is its 400G optical cage, so the ports mate correctly; the label in the note is the vendor's. 1U, dual power supplies, Quantum-2."
